      169.05,
      237.67,
      394.78,
      251.01
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PILIYANDALA DHARMASHASTRODAYA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      201.21,
      250.03,
      362.5,
      263.37
    ],
    "text": "PIRIVEN VIHARASTHA SANWARDHANA SABHAWA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      274.63,
      402.01,
      349.41
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Sabhawa called and known as the \u201cPiliyandalaDharmashastrodaya Piriven Viharastha SanwardhanaSabhawa\u201d has heretofore been formed at Piliyandala for thepurpose of effectually carrying out its objects and transactingall matters connected with the Sabhawa, according to therules agreed to, by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      360.67,
      402.03,
      423.21
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Sabhawa has applied to beincorporated in order to enable it more effectively to carryout and fulfil the several objects and purposes for which itwas formed and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      434.59,
      401.89,
      460.29
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      471.79,
      401.85,
      509.85
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the PiliyandalaDharmashastrodaya Piriven Viharastha SanwardhanaSabhawa (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2010.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      521.35,
      402.06,
      671.13
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of this Act,such and so many persons as now are members of thePiliyandala Dharmashastrodaya Pririven ViharasthaSanwardhana Sabhawa (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cSabhawa\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession, under the name and style of the \u201cPiliyandalaDharmashastrodaya Piriven Viharastha SanwardhanaSabhawa\u201d and by that name may sue and be sued in allcourts with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      522.98,
      455.81,
      610.45
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof thePiliyandalaDharma-shastrodayaPririvenViharasthaSanwardhanaSabhawa.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
