      213.55,
      401.83,
      250.89
    ],
    "text": "(k)to establish dhamma schools, and to provideknowledge of the dhamma to the youngergeneration ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      261.55,
      402.07,
      298.89
    ],
    "text": "(l)to communicate the message contained in theteachings of the Buddha and to propagate Buddhistculture with a view to promoting world peace;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      176.13,
      309.55,
      402.01,
      394.89
    ],
    "text": "(m)to present the Buddhist point of view on any matter,on behalf of the Buddhist community atconferences and seminars on global problemsrelating to education culture, communications,survival, development and peace, convened by anyinternational, governmental or non-governmentalorganizations, whether religious or secular;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      405.55,
      401.98,
      454.89
    ],
    "text": "(n)to initiate, co-ordinate and assist studies onproblems of survival, development, peace,education and culture, from a Buddhist perspectiveand to publish the results of such studies;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      465.55,
      401.94,
      490.89
    ],
    "text": "(o)to provide facilities for Buddhist leaders andscholars of the world to meet and discuss;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      501.55,
      402.08,
      562.89
    ],
    "text": "(p)to function as a documentation Centre for peaceoriented Buddhist Study groups meditation groups,mass-media groups and action groups and to providefor the exchange of information and the sharing ofexperiences;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
