    "text": "8. The Corporation shall be able and capable in law totake and hold any property, movable or immovable, whichmay become vested in it by virtue of any purchase, grant,gift, lease or testamentary disposition or otherwise, and allsuch property shall be held by the Corporation for thepurposes of this Act and subject to the rules of the Corporationfor the time being in force with full powers to sell, mortgage,lease, exchange or otherwise dispose of the same.",
